s ongoing. The game can be downloaded via itch.io.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--Qk3kT7Rx--/f_auto/v1776346547/posts/FQun0uLpF?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-17T14:27:26.113Z"},{"id":"8FMFapcoQ","title":"Extract Game - Free-to-Play, New Engine, New Art, New Minigame, New Mechanics, New Quests - Massive Patch #42","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/extract-game---free-to-play-new-engine-new-art-new-minigame-new-mechanics-new-quests---massive--8fmfapcoq","summary":"A solo developer released Patch #42 for Extract Game, a free-to-play crossplay multiplayer sandbox with web and Unreal Engine clients. The update introduces a new minigame (Wave Machine), reworked visuals, and improved web client performance. The game features 12 skills with progression systems, skill trees, procedurally generated worlds, crafting, trading, quests, and multiple minigames. Players can choose between Standard and Accelerated (3\u00d7 rewards) economies, with both clients sharing the same game world.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--_BNQwmVi--/f_auto/v1770618281/posts/uP81tFo8k?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-11T19:50:19.253Z"},{"id":"OZyz3Urrg","title":"Where we find insperation for our Character in Wake Up","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/where-we-find-insperation-for-our-character-in-wake-up-ozyz3urrg","summary":"A game development team shares the real-world inspiration behind character designs in their game \"Wake Up.\" The post reveals which people inspired the physical appearance, voice, and clothing of characters named Ammy and Alex, including reference images of the inspirational figures.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZJGunKjG--/f_auto/v1770643117/posts/8vH20mc1W?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-11T19:50:15.533Z"},{"id":"mG2I1wQgl","title":"BirdMMO!","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/birdmmo--mg2i1wqgl","summary":"A developer built a multiplayer bird photography MMO in 2 days using AI-assisted development with Three.js and Socket.io. The game features 30 biomes, day/night cycles, an achievement system, and collection mechanics. The project demonstrates rapid prototyping capabilities with modern web technologies and AI coding assistance.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--RFfWAJmi--/f_auto/v1770824094/posts/dYZ7Fxdxg?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":100,"num_comments":39,"created_at":"2026-02-11T19:50:09.646Z"},{"id":"WkRqXD9J4","title":"Run Across - My first complete Godot 4.5 mobile game (3 months solo dev)","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/run-across---my-first-complete-godot-4-5-mobile-game-3-months-solo-dev--wkrqxd9j4","summary":"A developer shares their experience building their first mobile game using Godot 4.5 over 3 months. The post covers technical implementation details including mobile optimization techniques (object pooling, shader warmup, quality presets), Firebase integration for authentication and leaderboards, responsive UI scaling, and challenges faced with Android plugins and performance issues. The game features dynamic biomes, combo systems, and runs on low-end devices with 1GB RAM through aggressive optimization strategies.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ewmaKsag--/f_auto/v1769705976/posts/wEJripg8B?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":12,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-01T14:17:39.196Z"},{"id":"Kvg9vJCZg","title":"I want to showcase and give feedback on indie projects","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/i-want-to-showcase-and-give-feedback-on-indie-projects-kvg9vjczg","summary":"A creator is launching a YouTube series to review and provide feedback on indie games, studios, and online projects. They're seeking submissions from developers who want constructive advice on their work, preferring requested feedback over unsolicited reviews.","image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-01T00:08:11.387Z"},{"id":"YmNT1NvRp","title":"What do you want to add in our game Wake Up","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-do-you-want-to-add-in-our-game-wake-up-ymnt1nvrp","summary":"The developers of Wake Up game are soliciting community feedback and feature requests. They're asking players to share creative ideas for additions to the game, with the possibility of implementing some suggestions.","image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-17T18:02:06.988Z"},{"id":"eZCtsIzMX","title":"Devlog Thread \u2014 Working Title: THE RECORD: Interview","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/devlog-thread-working-title-the-record-interview-ezctsizmx","summary":"A developer shares the first devlog for a narrative game built in Godot 4. The game focuses on reviewing interview transcripts where players decide what gets recorded as truth, exploring the gap between what's said and what's documented. No combat, exploration, or puzzles\u2014just decision-making about truth and lies.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--2AeDK_V8--/f_auto/v1766343440/posts/gP4EZPfBG?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":8,"num_comments":2,"created_at":"2025-12-25T04:58:33.287Z"},{"id":"d7djsTClQ","title":"How to make art for your game  even if you Suck at it","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-make-art-for-your-game-even-if-you-suck-at-it-d7djstclq","summary":"Discover tricks to create decent game art without having artistic skills, shared by a solo game developer. Learn methods to enhance your game's visuals even if you're not naturally talented in art.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--t7Mu4Ado--/f_auto/v1744994641/posts/F3fksVtS0","num_upvotes":115,"num_comments":12,"created_at":"2025-04-20T17:36:08.076Z"},{"id":"HDHhxClFh","title":"Please check out my portfolio","url":"","comments